  offerLine: Your cafe's boring to look at. Boring things don't get robbed, you know. Sorry, I mean visited. Three lanterns out. Two nights. Let's see what wanders in.
  activeLine: Three lanterns, two closings. Leave the rest to me. Don't check the bins.
  readyLine: Beautiful. I've found so many things. Right, you've got an eye, I've got a beak. Partners. I'll bring back anything that isn't nailed down. Those lights were just lying around, I swear.
  doneLine: So what's shiny today?
